<%- include('header') %><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">RECORD MANAGEMENT</span><h1>删除动物档案</h1><p>用于管理员处理误录或重复记录。</p></div><a class="button" href="/animals/<%= animal._id %>">返回详情</a></div><section class="panel form-panel"><div class="warning-box"><h2>请确认要删除的档案</h2><p>正式功能接入后，删除会同时清理关联的跟进与领养记录。</p></div><dl><dt>动物编号</dt><dd><%= animal.animalCode %></dd><dt>外观描述</dt><dd><%= animal.appearance %></dd><dt>发现地点</dt><dd><%= animal.foundLocation %></dd></dl><form method="dialog" data-preview="删除动物档案" class="spaced"><label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" required>我已确认这是误录或重复档案</label><%- include('form-actions', { cancelUrl: '/animals/' + animal._id, submitLabel: '预览删除确认' }) %></form></section><%- include('footer') %>
